ation":"16X9","width":"800","height":"450","altText":"Aeriel over Cleveland Qld 1973","caption":"Cleveland Qld Aeriel image 1973","photographer":"","copyright":"","sequenceNumber":"400"},{"marketVariantId":"","multimediaId":"6a94e29eb42831d423a1b786","authoredDate":"2026-08-31","serverPath":"https://assets.atdw-online.com.au/images/0398419a31e608cc9ba3fb552df31c6d.jpeg?rect=0%2C150%2C1600%2C900&w=280&h=158&rot=360&q=eyJ0eXBlIjoibGlzdGluZyIsImxpc3RpbmdJZCI6IjZhOGNkNDIwYTQyN2VmYjU0YTM1ZGU1YSIsImRpc3RyaWJ1dG9ySWQiOiI1NmIxZWI5MzQ0ZmVjYTNkZjJlMzIwY2IiLCJhcGlrZXlJZCI6IjU2YjFlZmVlMGNmMjEzYWQyMGRkMjE3MCJ9","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"IMAGE","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Image","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"16X9","width":"280","height":"158","altText":"Aeriel over Cleveland Qld 1973","caption":"Cleveland Qld Aeriel image 1973","photographer":"","copyright":"","sequenceNumber":"400"}],"openTimes":[],"productComments":[{"marketVariantId":"English / Global","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ENGLISH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"English","commentText":"Jan, Nola and Merle remember their carefree and joyful childhood spent around Cleveland and the bays, sharing tales about the Despot corner store, the movies, swimming days and strawberry floats.  \n\nAuthor John Dillon will add his stories of visiting his Uncle here. \n\nJoin this entertaining panel of speakers spark some memories and mull over 'the good old days'.\n\nIt's an afternoon of connection, reflection and real stories from real people.\n\nYour ticket includes morning tea and general entry to the Museum."},{"marketVariantId":"Indonesian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"INDONESIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Indonesian","commentText":"Jan, Nola, dan Merle mengenang masa kecil mereka yang riang dan penuh sukacita di sekitar Cleveland dan teluk-teluknya, berbagi cerita tentang toko Despot di pojok jalan, film, hari-hari berenang, dan pelampung stroberi.\n\nPenulis John Dillon akan menambahkan cerita-ceritanya tentang kunjungannya ke pamannya di sini.\n\nBergabunglah dengan panel pembicara yang menghibur ini untuk membangkitkan kenangan dan merenungkan 'masa lalu yang indah'.\n\nIni adalah sore hari untuk menjalin hubungan, refleksi, dan kisah nyata dari orang-orang nyata.\n\nTiket Anda termasuk teh pagi dan tiket masuk umum ke Museum."},{"marketVariantId":"Korean","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"KOREAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Korean","commentText":"얀 놀라 그리고 멀은 클리블랜드와 해안가에서 보낸 근심 걱정 없고 즐거웠던 어린 시절을 회상하며 데스포트 편의점 영화관 수영 딸기 튜브 타기에 얽힌 이야기를 나눕니다.\n\n작가 존 딜런은 이곳에 있는 삼촌을 방문했던 이야기를 들려줄 예정입니다.\n\n이 흥미진진한 패널 토론에 참여하여 추억을 되살리고 '좋았던 옛 시절'을 회상해 보세요.\n\n진솔한 사람들의 생생한 이야기와 함께 소통하고 과거를 되돌아보는 특별한 오후를 보내세요.\n\n티켓에는 간단한 다과와 박물관 일반 입장권이 포함되어 있습니다."},{"marketVariantId":"Italian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ITALIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Italian","commentText":"Jan, Nola e Merle ricordano la loro infanzia spensierata e gioiosa trascorsa a Cleveland e nelle baie, condividendo aneddoti sul negozio all'angolo di Despot, i film, le giornate in piscina e i gelati alla fragola.\n\nLo scrittore John Dillon aggiungerà i suoi racconti sulle visite allo zio.\n\nUnisciti a questo interessante gruppo di relatori per far riaffiorare ricordi e ripensare ai \"bei vecchi tempi\".\n\nSarà un pomeriggio di condivisione, riflessione e storie vere raccontate da persone vere.\n\nIl biglietto include la merenda e l'ingresso generale al Museo."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Simplified","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-S","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Simplified","commentText":"简、诺拉和默尔回忆起他们在克利夫兰和海湾附近度过的无忧无虑、快乐无比的童年时光，分享着关于德斯波特街角商店、电影、游泳和草莓冰淇淋的故事。\n\n作家约翰·狄龙也将讲述他当年探望叔叔的故事。\n\n加入我们，与这些风趣幽默的演讲者们一起，唤起美好的回忆，重温“美好的旧时光”。\n\n这是一个充满交流、反思和聆听真实故事的下午。\n\n您的门票包含上午茶点和博物馆门票。"},{"marketVariantId":"Portuguese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"PORT-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Portuguese","commentText":"Jan, Nola e Merle relembram a infância despreocupada e alegre que passaram em Cleveland e nas baías, compartilhando histórias sobre a mercearia Despot, os filmes, os dias de natação e os sorvetes de morango.\n\nO autor John Dillon também contará histórias de suas visitas ao tio.\n\nJunte-se a este divertido painel de palestrantes, reviva memórias e reflita sobre os \"bons tempos\".\n\nSerá uma tarde de conexão, reflexão e histórias reais de pessoas reais.\n\nSeu ingresso inclui café da manhã e entrada geral no Museu."},{"marketVariantId":"Japanese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"JAPANESE","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Japanese","commentText":"ジャン、ノーラ、マールは、クリーブランドとその湾岸で過ごした、のびのびと楽しい子供時代を懐かしく思い出します。デスポットの雑貨店、映画、水泳、イチゴのフロートなど、思い出話に花を咲かせます。\n\n作家のジョン・ディロンは、叔父を訪ねた時の思い出を語ります。\n\n楽しい講演者によるパネルディスカッションに参加して、懐かしい思い出を振り返り、「古き良き時代」を思い起こしましょう。\n\n午後のひとときを、人と人との繋がり、振り返り、そして人々の生の声に耳を傾けながら過ごしましょう。\n\nチケットには、モーニングティーと博物館への入場料が含まれています。"},{"marketVariantId":"Spanish","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"SPAN-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Spanish","commentText":"Jan, Nola y Merle rememoran su infancia despreocupada y alegre en Cleveland y sus alrededores, compartiendo anécdotas sobre la tienda de la esquina Despot, el cine, los días de natación y los helados de fresa.\n\nEl autor John Dillon compartirá sus historias sobre sus visitas a su tío.\n\nÚnase a este entretenido panel de oradores para revivir recuerdos y rememorar los viejos tiempos.\n\nSerá una tarde de conexión, reflexión e historias reales contadas por personas reales.\n\nSu entrada incluye el té de la mañana y el acceso general al museo."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Traditional","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-T","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Traditional","commentText":"珍、諾拉和默爾回憶起他們在克利夫蘭和海灣附近度過的無憂無慮、快樂無比的童年時光，分享著關於德斯波特街角商店、電影、游泳和草莓冰淇淋的故事。\n\n作家約翰狄龍也將講述他當年探望叔叔的故事。\n\n加入我們，與這些風趣幽默的演講者們一起，喚起美好的回憶，重溫「美好的舊時光」。\n\n這是一個充滿交流、反思和聆聽真實故事的下午。\n\n您的門票包含上午茶點和博物館門票。"},{"marketVariantId":"French","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"FRENCH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"French","commentText":"Jan, Nola et Merle se souviennent avec émotion de leur enfance insouciante et joyeuse passée à Cleveland et dans ses baies. Ils partagent des anecdotes sur l'épicerie du coin, les séances de cinéma, les baignades et les batailles de fraises.\n\nL'auteur John Dillon partagera également ses souvenirs de visites chez son oncle.\n\nRejoignez cette table ronde passionnante pour raviver vos souvenirs et vous remémorer le bon vieux temps.\n\nUn après-midi d'échanges, de réflexion et de témoignages authentiques.\n\nVotre billet comprend le thé du matin et l'entrée au musée."},{"marketVariantId":"German","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"GERMAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"German","commentText":"Jan, Nola und Merle erinnern sich an ihre unbeschwerte und fröhliche Kindheit in Cleveland und Umgebung und erzählen von ihrem kleinen Laden an der Ecke, den Kinobesuchen, den Badetagen und den Erdbeer-Eisbechern.\n\nAutor John Dillon wird seine Geschichten von Besuchen bei seinem Onkel hier beisteuern.\n\nErleben Sie eine unterhaltsame Podiumsdiskussion, lassen Sie Erinnerungen aufleben und schwelgen Sie in Erinnerungen an die gute alte Zeit.\n\nEs erwartet Sie ein Nachmittag voller Begegnungen, Reflexionen und authentischer Geschichten von echten Menschen.\n\nIhre Eintrittskarte beinhaltet einen kleinen Imbiss und den allgemeinen Eintritt ins Museum."}],"productSite":[{"siteName":"Redlands Coast Museum","attributeIdSiteType":"VENUE","attributeIdSiteTypeDescription":"Venue","productSiteAddressRelationship":[{"attributeIdAddress":"PHYSICAL","attributeIdAddressDescription":"Physical","addressLine1":"60 Smith Street","addressLine2":"","suburbName":"","cityName":"Cleveland","areaName":"","stateName":"Queensland","countryName":"Australia","addressPostalCode":"4163","overrideDomesticRegionFlag":"0","geocodeGdaLatitude":"-27.5341842","geocodeGdaLongitude":"153.2598394","productSiteAddressStreetDirectoryRelationship":""}],"productSiteAttributeRelationship":"","productSiteCommentRelationship":"","productSiteCommunicationRelationship":"","productSiteLicenceRelationship":"","productSiteRelatedSiteRelationship":"","productSiteMultimediaRelationship":"","productSiteContactRelationship":""}],"mediaLinks":[],"alternateNames":[],"internationalReach":"","rates":[{"ratesType":"ALLTICKETS","ratesTypeDescription":"All tickets","priceFrom":"7.50","priceTo":"19.50","free":"","rateComment":"Adult - Floor Talk + Morning Tea: $19.50\nConcession - Floor Talk + Morning Tea: $15.50\nRCM Member - Floor Talk + Morning Tea: $7.50\n\nBooking Fees Apply"}],"deals":[],"weather":"","menuUrl":"","winelistUrl":"","doesServeMeal":"","openingTime":{"openingTimeType":"","seasonalPeriods":[],"openingTimeComment":"","exceptions":{"exceptionPeriod":"","periods":[]}},"productProximity":[],"productWidget":[],"services":[],"verticalClassifications":[{"productTypeId":"EVTCLASS","productTypeDescription":"Classes, Lessons, Workshops and Talks"}],"pageURL":"/au/en/things-to-do/events/p-6a8cd420a427efb54a35de5a-show-n-tell-kids-on-the-block--life-in-the-50s--60s","classificationLayer":[{"attributeId":"classes-and-workshops"}]}}]},"disabledClassifications":["participation-and-endurance","markets-and-community","business-event","food-and-wine","music-and-festivals"]}